WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.566
Here's a paid event, start to finish.

2
00:00:03.507 --> 00:00:06.085
From your brand's home, tap plus,

3
00:00:06.107 --> 00:00:07.932
choose Create event,

4
00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:09.574
then Ticketed event.

5
00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.189
Step one is the basics.

6
00:00:14.195 --> 00:00:15.171
Give it a name,

7
00:00:15.171 --> 00:00:17.261
and say whether it's in person,

8
00:00:17.262 --> 00:00:19.154
online, or both.

9
00:00:19.845 --> 00:00:21.275
Pick a party type,

10
00:00:21.319 --> 00:00:23.526
then the vibe tags and every

11
00:00:23.526 --> 00:00:24.627
genre you'll play.

12
00:00:24.744 --> 00:00:26.366
They all show up as tags

13
00:00:26.366 --> 00:00:27.720
on your event page.

14
00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:29.626
Finish with a short

15
00:00:29.626 --> 00:00:30.601
description of the night.

16
00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:36.753
Step two: when.

17
00:00:36.939 --> 00:00:38.283
A single date,

18
00:00:38.283 --> 00:00:39.962
then when doors open

19
00:00:39.962 --> 00:00:41.353
and when it ends.

20
00:00:41.468 --> 00:00:43.272
It can run past midnight

21
00:00:43.337 --> 00:00:45.643
Mingla works out the length for you.

22
00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.063
Step three: where.

23
00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:52.135
Name the venue and search for the address.

24
00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:54.424
With hide address on,

25
00:00:54.431 --> 00:00:57.387
only people with a ticket see where it is.

26
00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:02.167
Step four is how it looks.

27
00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:05.446
Add a video cover, up to fifteen seconds.

28
00:01:05.645 --> 00:01:08.197
Mingla uploads it and gets it ready

29
00:01:08.308 --> 00:01:11.081
that takes a moment, so we've sped it up.

30
00:01:11.779 --> 00:01:12.953
Under the cover,

31
00:01:12.953 --> 00:01:15.154
add more photos, up to eight.

32
00:01:15.357 --> 00:01:18.196
Guests swipe through them after the video.

33
00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:20.317
Then the theme:

34
00:01:20.323 --> 00:01:22.448
a colour, a typeface,

35
00:01:22.448 --> 00:01:23.876
and a little motion.

36
00:01:24.033 --> 00:01:26.244
The preview changes as you choose.

37
00:01:40.347 --> 00:01:42.620
Step five: tickets.

38
00:01:42.766 --> 00:01:43.705
Name it.

39
00:01:43.985 --> 00:01:45.330
Set the price

40
00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:47.409
it's in your brand's currency,

41
00:01:47.409 --> 00:01:48.282
dollars here

42
00:01:48.302 --> 00:01:50.027
and how many you're selling.

43
00:01:50.782 --> 00:01:53.563
Turn on a waitlist for when it sells out,

44
00:01:53.570 --> 00:01:55.909
and allow transfers so a guest

45
00:01:55.909 --> 00:01:57.353
can pass a ticket on.

46
00:01:57.856 --> 00:02:00.462
Save it, and you'll see capacity

47
00:02:00.462 --> 00:02:02.107
and the most it can take.

48
00:02:03.413 --> 00:02:06.176
Step six: keep it public,

49
00:02:06.181 --> 00:02:08.748
so anyone on Mingla can find it.

50
00:02:09.313 --> 00:02:11.138
Step seven checks the night

51
00:02:11.138 --> 00:02:12.359
before it goes out:

52
00:02:12.514 --> 00:02:14.626
demand, competition,

53
00:02:14.626 --> 00:02:16.371
and a likely turnout.

54
00:02:16.564 --> 00:02:18.860
It's a band, not a promise.

55
00:02:19.549 --> 00:02:22.524
Publish, and sales open straight away.

56
00:02:23.213 --> 00:02:24.694
And it's live.

57
00:02:24.852 --> 00:02:26.106
The cover plays,

58
00:02:26.106 --> 00:02:28.079
your photos sit underneath,

59
00:02:28.107 --> 00:02:30.230
and your tags are right there,

60
00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:31.761
with tickets left.

61
00:02:32.414 --> 00:02:34.347
Every customer Mingla drives

62
00:02:34.347 --> 00:02:36.167
your way lands on this page.
